{
  "title": "Revise Plan",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4586165f93f54e62",
      "text": "Choose how the model redrafts a plan, then press Revise; talk it over with the model first if you like. Opened by ✎ on a plan's status line, it reads the plan to its left. How it all works: [[Revise Plan Help]]."
    },
    {
      "type": "plan",
      "id": "f78b0ed0737853c1",
      "text": "REVISE"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "2f259de355050f9b",
      "text": "# Where Things Go\n> Nothing is written until you fork the ghost."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "ff78e3a681f188d7",
      "text": "The redraft opens to the right as a ghost with the plan's own title. Forking it saves it over the plan through the journal, which keeps the way it was made, your direction and how many turns of talk it drew on; Rewind on the plan's status line goes back. The talk and your direction stay in this browser tab."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "f54133fcf9dfbf15",
      "text": "# Privacy\n> The plan, your direction and the talk go to the model you choose."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "d3666da9e4f915fc",
      "text": "They are sent to the model on the ⚙ chip: the LLM coop's open models, or Claude on the farm's account ([[Model Settings]]). When a coop model fails the run moves up to Claude, and the failure — the model, the plan's title, the size of the question and the error — is logged on Coop Model Failures on coop.private.fish, where the coop can read it. Only the site's owner can revise or talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "eea270d83f00ed3a",
      "text": "# See"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "68d29174306ea1a8",
      "text": "- [[Revise Plan Help]]\n- [[Plan Tool]]\n- [[Model Settings]]\n- [[About Plan Plugin]]"
    }
  ],
